This is for those of you who are interested in building 
NetHack 3.0 on a VMS machine.

Dave Gentzel (gentzel@b.psc.edu) has ported NetHack 3.0
to VMS, and he has been play-testing it successfully during 
the past few weeks.  His port will be included in Patch 4.

Dave did a splendid job, but he could use some help
from expert VMS users to further test the port before it
is inflicted on the public.  If this description fits you
and you are willing, please contact Dave directly through
the email address enclosed above.  Thanks.

-Izchak


